==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|store|house|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A building for keeping goods of any kind, especially provisions; a magazine; a repository; a [[warehouse]].
# {{lb|en|figurative|by extension}} A single location or resource where a large quantity of something can be found.
#: ''This old book is a genuine '''storehouse''' of useful cooking tips.''
# {{label|en|obsolete}} A mass or quantity laid up.
#: {{rfquotek|Spenser}}

